  "notes": "AgroGalaxy Participa\u00e7\u00f5es (AGXY3) \u2014 Brazilian ag-input retail consolidator backed by Aqua Capital. IPO on B3 Novo Mercado September 2021 (R$350M primary at R$15/share). Roll-up of 7+ regional revendas (Agrosema, Sementes Boa F\u00e9, Conex\u00e3o Agro, Produagro, Agro100, Sementes Goi\u00e1s, etc.) selling seeds, fertilizers, defensivos (chemicals) and specialty products to ~50k+ farmers across MT/MS/GO/MG/SP/PR/RS/MA/TO/BA. Revenue and margins highly correlated to commodity price cycles + farmer credit health. BRL reporting, calendar fiscal year. grossRevenueMM = receita bruta, revenueMM = receita l\u00edquida. CRITICAL CONTEXT: Company filed for recupera\u00e7\u00e3o judicial (judicial reorganization, equivalent of US Chapter 11) on 13-Sep-2024 amid farmer-credit collapse, soybean-price decline, and over-leveraged balance sheet. Stock fell ~95% from IPO. FY24 figures preliminary / heavily impaired. Expense split: CPV (cost of product sold), G&A (despesas administrativas), D&A (deprecia\u00e7\u00e3o), Outras (provis\u00f5es/PDD/impairment). Source: CVM ITR/DFP filings + ri.agrogalaxy.com.br release decks. Pre-IPO 2020 figures from S-1 (Prospecto).",
